{"anime_data":{"id":235612,"name":"はたらく細胞","name_cn":"工作细胞","short_summary":"这是一个关于你自身的故事。你体内的故事——。\r\n人的细胞数量，约为37兆2千亿个。\r\n细胞们在名为身体的世界中，今天也精神满满、无休无眠地在工作着。\r\n运送着氧气的红细胞，与细菌战斗的白细胞……！\r\n这里，有着细胞们不为人知的故事。","score":6.9,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/84/fc/235612_EHO4Q.jpg","eps":14,"date":"2018-07-07","summary":"这是一个关于你自身的故事。你体内的故事——。\r\n人的细胞数量，约为37兆2千亿个。\r\n细胞们在名为身体的世界中，今天也精神满满、无休无眠地在工作着。\r\n运送着氧气的红细胞，与细菌战斗的白细胞……！\r\n这里，有着细胞们不为人知的故事。","total_episodes":19,"characters":[{"id":60455,"name":"赤血球","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c5/b3/60455_crt_FD4cR.jpg?r=1516938274","actor_ids":[4765,78664,79188,79255],"name_cn":"红血球（AE3803）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"红血球（AE3803）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60456,"name":"白血球","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/79/53/60456_crt_6EUyY.jpg?r=1516938387","actor_ids":[5121,16266,39898,79177,79256],"name_cn":"白血球（U-1146）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"白血球（U-1146）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60457,"name":"キラーT細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/25/ce/60457_crt_5q7s9.jpg?r=1537843531","actor_ids":[4456,18733,31084,76687,79232],"name_cn":"杀手T细胞","summary":"ウイルス感染細胞、癌細胞などの異物を認識・破壊する殺し屋。\r\nヘルパーＴ細胞の命令によって出動する。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"杀手T细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"http://hataraku-saibou.com/character/?chara=killer_t_cell","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60458,"name":"マクロファージ","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/bb/04/60458_crt_T17VN.jpg?r=1537843706","actor_ids":[3945,15805,25335,46342,78953,78955,79081]